  / Static Glowing Border demo
  .row.justify-content-center.mt-5
    .col-md-12
      .container.text-center
        %h2.mb-4{"data-aos" => "fade-up"} Static Glowing Border Variations
        %p.mb-5{"data-aos" => "fade-up", "data-aos-delay" => "100"} Beautiful static glowing borders with different angles and hover effects

        / Left-aligned static border
        .static-glowing-border{"data-aos" => "fade-right"}
          %h1 Static Glow Effect
          %p This is a static version of the glowing border without animation. Perfect for content that needs to stand out without being distracting.

        / Right-aligned static border with different angle
        .static-glowing-border.right.angle-180{"data-aos" => "fade-left"}
          %h1 Right Aligned
          %p This version is aligned to the right with a different glow angle. Notice how the border curves in the opposite direction.

        / Center full border without cuts
        .row.justify-content-center.mb-4
          .col-md-8
            .static-glowing-border.full-border{"data-aos" => "fade-up", "data-aos-delay" => "100"}
              %h1 Complete Glow Border
              %p This version has a complete border all around without any cuts or gaps. Perfect for highlighting important content with a full glowing frame.

